      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 832,
        "content": "## Log construction punch list items with AI, Google Sheets, Gmail and Telegram\n\n### How it works\n\nA site supervisor sends a punch list item to your Telegram bot, for example \"cracked tile in unit 3B bathroom, high priority\". The AI parses the message into a structured item with location, trade, severity and description, looks up the responsible subcontractor from the Trade Roster sheet, logs the item to the Punch Log, emails the subcontractor, confirms to the supervisor, and alerts the project manager on Telegram for high severity items. Every Monday the workflow emails and posts a weekly report of open punch items.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Create a spreadsheet with two tabs: PunchLog and TradeRoster.\n- Add your subcontractors with trade, company and email to the TradeRoster tab.\n- Connect Telegram, Google Sheets, OpenAI and Gmail credentials.\n- Open a chat with your bot and send your first punch item.\n- Set the project manager email and Telegram chat id in the weekly report nodes.\n\n### Customization\n\n- Change the weekly schedule, add more trades, or route alerts to Slack or Discord."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
